CalculatePlanets←{
   ⍝ Positions of sun, moon, planets and comet for observer ⍵ (LAT,DATE,TIME)
   ⍝ Result is PLANETS AA VP PLANETCOORD PHASE AAE
    date←⍵[2]
    bodies←date EarthView date PlanetPos(3≠⍳9)⌿Data.planets
    sun←date EarthView 1 3⍴0 0 0
    comet←100≥|date-Jnu 12 28 1973
    comet←date EarthView(date/⍨comet)CometPos Data.kohoutek
    lunar←MoonPos date
    phase←lunar[1;1]MoonPhase sun[1;1]
    bodies←lunar,[1]sun,[1]bodies,[1]comet
    lunar←lunar[;3]ParallaxAdjust ⍵ SkyPos lunar[;1 2]
    aa←lunar,[1]⍵ SkyPos 1 0↓bodies
    vp←Visible aa
    aae←vp⌿aa
    bodies aa vp(MapCartesian Projection aae)phase aae }
